This example includes a curated excerpt derived from:

  A global dataset of UHPC mix designs with supplementary cementitious materials,
  nano additives, and sustainable fillers (Version 2)
  Malik, U. J.; Lee, C. K.; Mohotti, D.; Mo, H. — University of New South Wales (UNSW Canberra)
  Mendeley Data — https://doi.org/10.17632/czb7ww5pkz.2

