Changes made: a 19-row excerpt (seven mixes) was selected from the 2,188-mix source table by reading
its fixed kg/m3 constituent and strength columns, and re-formatted into the Open3DCP flat schema. Each
(mix x reported compressive age) becomes one row; 28-day flexural, elastic-modulus and splitting-tensile
results are attached to the latest-age row. Constituent masses (kg/m3) and mechanical values (MPa, GPa)
are copied unchanged; the source table is not redistributed (download it from the DOI). See SOURCE.md
and build/extract.py.

The companion data paper is published in Data in Brief (doi:10.1016/j.dib.2025.112179).
